/**
Deque: Doubly ended queue

Header File : <deque>

Similarity:
--> Same as vector
--> random access
--> doubly ended so insert or delete from both ends

-----------------------------------------------------------
Insert:
(i) push_front() : d.push_front(30)
(ii)push_back () : d.push_back(40)
(iii) insert  (pos,val): insert(v.begin() + 1,45)
--------------------------------------------------------
Delete:
(i) pop_front() : d.pop_front()
(ii)pop_back() : d.pop_back()
(iii)erase(pos,value): d.erase(v.begin() + 1,30)
---------------------------------------------------------
Accessing:
(i) Using indexing
(ii) Using .at() : d.at(index)
--------------------------------------------------------
Traversing:
(i) Same as vector : for loop
---------------------------------------------------------
Clear:
d.clear() // removes all element
